```

ist nicht mehr einfach:

```text
FILE
```

sondern:

```text
FILE
 └── REPRESENTATION
      └── EDITION
           └── WORK
                └── AUTHOR
```

Eine FLAC-Datei:

```text
FILE
 └── AUDIO REPRESENTATION
      └── RECORDING
           └── RELEASE
                └── ARTIST
```

Ein Foto:

```text
FILE
 └── REPRESENTATION
      └── IMAGE ASSET
           └── CAPTURE
                ├── RAW
                ├── JPEG
